          <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M12 2C6.48 2 2 6.48 2 12s4.48 10 10 10 10-4.48 10-10S17.52 2 12 2zm1 15h-2v-6h2v6zm0-8h-2V7h2v2z" fill="#a78bfa"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div style="font-family:'Bebas Neue',sans-serif;font-size:1.6rem;letter-spacing:0.06em;color:var(--fg1);">HOW TO IMPORT YOUR TEST</div>
      </div>
      <div style="font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:0.65rem;color:var(--fg3);letter-spacing:0.06em;margin-bottom:1.6rem;">Use any AI (ChatGPT, Gemini, Claude, etc.) to convert your test into Buddy format in seconds.</div>

      <!-- steps -->
      <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px;margin-bottom:1.4rem;">

        <div style="display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:flex-start;padding:12px 14px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.03);border:1px solid var(--bd);border-radius:14px;">
          <div style="width:26px;height:26px;border-radius:50%;background:rgba(var(--acc-rgb),0.18);border:1px solid rgba(var(--acc-rgb),0.3);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-family:'Bebas Neue',sans-serif;font-size:1rem;color:var(--acc);flex-shrink:0;margin-top:1px;">1</div>
          <div>
            <div style="font-size:0.85rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--fg1);margin-bottom:3px;">Open any AI and give it your test data</div>
            <div style="font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:0.62rem;color:var(--fg3);line-height:1.7;">Either <strong style="color:var(--fg2);">type out</strong> your scores (subject-wise marks, total, date), <strong style="color:var(--fg2);">attach a photo</strong> of your answer sheet or result page, or <strong style="color:var(--fg2);">upload the PDF</strong> of your test result. Any format works.</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div style="display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:flex-start;padding:12px 14px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.03);border:1px solid var(--bd);border-radius:14px;">
          <div style="width:26px;height:26px;border-radius:50%;background:rgba(167,139,250,0.18);border:1px solid rgba(167,139,250,0.3);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-family:'Bebas Neue',sans-serif;font-size:1rem;color:var(--vio);flex-shrink:0;margin-top:1px;">2</div>
          <div>
            <div style="font-size:0.85rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--fg1);margin-bottom:3px;">Copy the prompt below and paste it</div>
            <div style="font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:0.62rem;color:var(--fg3);line-height:1.7;">Paste the prompt after your test data in the same message. The AI will output a JSON file ready to import directly into Buddy.</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div style="display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:flex-start;padding:12px 14px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.03);border:1px solid var(--bd);border-radius:14px;">
          <div style="width:26px;height:26px;border-radius:50%;background:rgba(45,207,158,0.18);border:1px solid rgba(45,207,158,0.3);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-family:'Bebas Neue',sans-serif;font-size:1rem;color:var(--grn);flex-shrink:0;margin-top:1px;">3</div>
          <div>
            <div style="font-size:0.85rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--fg1);margin-bottom:3px;">Save the JSON and import it here</div>
            <div style="font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:0.62rem;color:var(--fg3);line-height:1.7;">Copy the AI's output, save it as a <strong style="color:var(--fg2);">.json</strong> file, then click the <strong style="color:var(--fg2);">IMPORT</strong> button on this page and select the file.</div>
          </div>
        </div>

